The Members module allows you to invite users to your workspace and assign roles, teams, and responsibilities.

## Members Page

Collaborate seamlessly by managing all users in one centralized system.

## Members Table

{% table %}
- Member Name
- Teams
- Email
- Team Role
- Actions
{% /table %}

## Add Team Member

### Purpose

Invite a new user into your workspace and define their role and access.

## Member Form Fields

### First Name *

Enter the first name.

**Example:** John

### Last Name *

Enter the last name.

**Example:** Doe

### Role *

Select user role.

**Example:**

- Member
- Manager
- Client
- Admin

### Position

Define job title or role.

**Example:**

- Designer
- Developer
- Project Manager

### Email *

Enter valid email address.

**Example:** john@example.com

### Select Teams

Assign user to one or more teams.

## Member Details Page

### Example

- Name: Similique provident Eligendi praesentium
- Email: wetil69645@daikoa.com
- Position: N/A
- Team Role: Client
- Teams: G

## Member Activity Table

{% table %}
- Task Name
- Project Name
- Priority
- Date
- Status
- Assignee
{% /table %}

## Summary

Members are active users who execute tasks, manage projects, and collaborate within assigned teams.
